[Notes.DisclaimerExpert_AbstrInv1 DisAbstractItem]
m_ItemName="Assassin's Run"
m_PluralItemName=""
m_Description="Armed with just a crossbow, proceed through the level and shoot your targets as fast as possible while avoiding to shoot civilians.\n\nThis challenge will test your mobility and your accuracy. \nThe area is full of enemies and hazards.\nEach room is sealed until you shoot every target in it. \nYour Crossbow has an infinite amount of bolts.\n\nScoring:\n* The faster you make it to the end, the more points you score.\n* Be accurate - aim for the head! - and shoot enemies with flair for a better score.\n* Shooting Civilians subtracts from your score.\n\nGame Over: \nThe challenge is over if you die."

